<title>FINLAND: LASSILA 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 22.7 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>LASSILA 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 22.7 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items    94.1 vs 76.7</p>
<p> Net sales				  973.8  vs 908.3</p>
<p> Operating profit			 113.6  vs 98.2</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 19.5 vs 21.5 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		 charge 0.4 vs 0.3 gain</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes	93.7 vs 77.0</p>
<p> Taxes					  26.6 vs 18.9</p>
<p> Net profit				   67.1 vs 58.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)(1)	17.67 vs 15.18</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     39.5 vs 36.6 at end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish plastic and cleaning equipment</p>
<p>maker is Lassila &amp; Tikanoja Oy.</p>
<p>(1)  - Diluted Jan-Aug EPS 1996 is 16.94 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
